  "text": "Title: Sunny Nights \n\nRealising that Sunny Nights is a crime narrative first and foremost helped me make sense of what initially seemed like an \nodd structure; the show unfolds in hour-long episodes rather than the snappier 20 to 30 minutes typical of comedies. The\nlight, humorous elements give the series leeway when it dabbles with incredulous moments or lifts well-worn tropes from \nthe playbook. The characters are always fun to spend time with.",
